{"seq":3,"slug":"embedding-models","title":"嵌入模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-search-retrieval/neural-retrieval/embedding-models","wordCount":1221,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"嵌入模型\">嵌入模型</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>嵌入模型（Embedding Model）是将文本映射为固定维度数值向量的神经网络，是稠密检索、语义搜索和 RAG 系统的基础组件。一个好的嵌入模型应该使语义相近的文本在向量空间中距离更近，语义无关的文本距离更远。它在检索管线中的直接消费者是<a href=\"dense-retrieval\">稠密检索</a>——双塔架构的查询编码器与文档编码器本质上就是一个嵌入模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 嵌入模型训练&#10;        DATA[大规模文本对] --&gt; PRE[预训练阶段]&#10;        PRE --&gt; FT[对比学习微调]&#10;        FT --&gt; INST[指令微调]&#10;        INST --&gt; MODEL[嵌入模型]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 应用场景&#10;        MODEL --&gt; RET[语义检索]&#10;        MODEL --&gt; SIM[文本相似度]&#10;        MODEL --&gt; CLU[聚类分析]&#10;        MODEL --&gt; CLS[零样本分类]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 嵌入模型训练\n        DATA[大规模文本对] --&gt; PRE[预训练阶段]\n        PRE --&gt; FT[对比学习微调]\n        FT --&gt; INST[指令微调]\n        INST --&gt; MODEL[嵌入模型]\n    end\n    subgraph 应用场景\n        MODEL --&gt; RET[语义检索]\n        MODEL --&gt; SIM[文本相似度]\n        MODEL --&gt; CLU[聚类分析]\n        MODEL --&gt; CLS[零样本分类]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>最大长度</th>\n<th>MTEB 均分</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>text-embedding-3-large</td>\n<td>3072</td>\n<td>8191</td>\n<td>64.6</td>\n<td>未公开</td>\n<td>支持维度裁剪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BGE-large-zh-v1.5</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>63.5</td>\n<td>326M</td>\n<td>中文优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>E5-mistral-7b</td>\n<td>4096</td>\n<td>32768</td>\n<td>66.6</td>\n<td>7B</td>\n<td>长文本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GTE-Qwen2-7B</td>\n<td>3584</td>\n<td>131072</td>\n<td>67.2</td>\n<td>7B</td>\n<td>超长上下文</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cohere embed-v3</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>512</td>\n<td>64.5</td>\n<td>未公开</td>\n<td>多语言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>jina-embeddings-v3</td>\n<td>1024</td>\n<td>8192</td>\n<td>65.5</td>\n<td>570M</td>\n<td>任务自适应</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"对比学习训练框架\">对比学习训练框架</h2><p>对比学习（Contrastive Learning）是训练嵌入模型的核心方法。基本思想是拉近正样本对（语义相似的文本）的向量距离，推远负样本对（语义不相关的文本）的向量距离。</p>\n<p>InfoNCE 是最常用的对比学习损失函数。给定一个 anchor、一个正样本和 N-1 个负样本，InfoNCE 损失将正样本识别问题转化为 N 分类问题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ContrastiveBatch {&#10;  anchors: Float32Array[];&#10;  positives: Float32Array[];&#10;  negatives: Float32Array[][];&#10;  temperature: number;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function infoNCELoss(batch: ContrastiveBatch): number {&#10;  const { anchors, positives, negatives, temperature } = batch;&#10;  let totalLoss = 0;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; anchors.length; i++) {&#10;    const posSim = cosineSimilarity(anchors[i], positives[i]) / temperature;&#10;    let logSumExp = Math.exp(posSim);&#10;&#10;    for (const neg of negatives[i]) {&#10;      const negSim = cosineSimilarity(anchors[i], neg) / temperature;&#10;      logSumExp += Math.exp(negSim);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    totalLoss += -posSim + Math.log(logSumExp);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return totalLoss / anchors.length;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function cosineSimilarity(a: Float32Array, b: Float32Array): number {&#10;  let dot = 0,&#10;    normA = 0,&#10;    normB = 0;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; a.length; i++) {&#10;    dot += a[i] * b[i];&#10;    normA += a[i] * a[i];&#10;    normB += b[i] * b[i];&#10;  }&#10;  return dot / (Math.sqrt(normA) * Math.sqrt(normB) + 1e-8);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContrastiveBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  anchors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  positives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  negatives</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> infoNCELoss</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ContrastiveBatch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">anchors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">positives</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">negatives</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">temperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalLoss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anchors.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> posSim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cosineSimilarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(anchors[i], positives[i]) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> logSumExp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(posSim);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> neg</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> negatives[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> negSim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cosineSimilarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(anchors[i], neg) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> temperature;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      logSumExp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">exp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(negSim);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    totalLoss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">posSim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(logSumExp);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalLoss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anchors.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> cosineSimilarity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Float32Array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normA </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    normB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dot </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(normA) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sqrt</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(normB) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e-8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>训练数据的构造策略对模型质量至关重要。高质量的训练对包括：查询-文档对（搜索日志）、问题-答案对（QA 数据集）、前提-蕴含对（NLI 数据集）、标题-正文对（百科/论文）。大规模弱监督数据（如网页标题-内容对）可以用于预训练阶段，精标数据用于微调阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"指令感知嵌入\">指令感知嵌入</h2><p>传统嵌入模型对所有任务使用相同的编码方式，无法区分检索、分类、聚类等不同任务的语义需求。指令感知嵌入（Instruction-aware Embedding）通过在输入文本前添加任务指令（Task Instruction），让模型根据不同任务生成不同的向量表示。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface TaskInstruction {&#10;  retrieval: string;&#10;  classification: string;&#10;  clustering: string;&#10;  sts: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const E5_INSTRUCTIONS: TaskInstruction = {&#10;  retrieval: &#39;query: &#39;,&#10;  classification: &#39;classify: &#39;,&#10;  clustering: &#39;cluster: &#39;,&#10;  sts: &#39;similarity: &#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;const BGE_INSTRUCTIONS: TaskInstruction = {&#10;  retrieval: &#39;Represent this sentence for searching relevant passages: &#39;,&#10;  classification: &#39;Represent this sentence for classifying: &#39;,&#10;  clustering: &#39;Represent this sentence for clustering: &#39;,&#10;  sts: &#39;Represent this sentence: &#39;,&#10;};&#10;&#10;interface InstructionAwareEncoder {&#10;  encode(text: string, instruction: string): Promise&lt;Float32Array&gt;;&#10;  encodeBatch(texts: string[], instruction: string): Promise&lt;Float32Array[]&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TaskInstruction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  retrieval</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></sp